    "application": "BambuStudio-02.05.00.66",
    "profile_title": "improved support around camera button",
    "profile_notes": "I tried a few cases for my iphone 16 pro max and thought this one was the best. I loved mixing the TPU and the PLA and the way the buttons feel when pressed. The only thing I did not like was that the area for the camera button seemed to have very little support once printed with a thin strand bridging the case on either side of the button. This is an attempt to correct that with access to the button still present but with more support around it to add more strength to the case overall. Thank you to PrintZag for the excellent work.",
